    <briefdescription>
<para>Represent the ILP of the subDAG rooted at a DAG node. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>ILPValues summarize the DAG subtree rooted at each node. ILPValues are valid for all nodes regardless of their subtree membership.</para>
<para>When computed using bottom-up DFS, this metric assumes that the DAG is a forest of trees with roots at the bottom of the schedule branching upward. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
